            <strong class="text-white">Buy 3/8 inch first.</strong> It carries enough torque for most fasteners, fits most spaces, and gives enough feel to know when a bolt is about to yield. Nothing else covers as much ground in a single set.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
